<p class="kicker">Process transparency</p>
<h1>How it was made</h1>
<blockquote>
  <p>This project was conceived through a conversation between a human initiator and ChatGPT, and its initial implementation was directed to Claude. We embrace AI-assisted creation and openly credit it. We publish the decisions, prompts, code, build process and costs that can responsibly be shared. We don't present AI work as secretly human-made, and we don't claim access to hidden model reasoning or private information.</p>
</blockquote>

