<h2>Rebuild this site yourself</h2>
<pre><code>git clone {{ repoUrl }}.git
cd charter
npm ci
npm test        # builds _site/ and runs the checks
</code></pre>
<p>It needs Node 20 or newer. No accounts, API keys or network services are needed after <code>npm ci</code>. <a href="{% sourceLink "DEPLOYMENT.md" %}"><code>DEPLOYMENT.md</code></a> covers hosting it anywhere, and <a href="{% sourceLink "CHANGELOG.md" %}"><code>CHANGELOG.md</code></a> lists what changed.</p>

<h2>What isn't published, and why</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Model internals.</strong> Hidden system prompts and private reasoning aren't available to us, so we can't publish them, and we don't pretend otherwise.</li>
  <li><strong>The raw ChatGPT account export.</strong> It covers unrelated private chats. Only a human-reviewed, single-conversation edition will be published. See <a href="/conversation/">the founding conversation</a>.</li>
  <li><strong>Credentials and account identifiers.</strong> These are never committed.</li>
</ul>

